---
// 关于页面 - 技术影响力导向
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>关于 - zgx197</title>
  <meta name="description" content="张国鑫 - AI时代的游戏开发者，专注于AI与游戏的融合创新。前百度知识图谱算法工程师，独立游戏开发者，ACMer。">
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #f8f9fa;
      --card-bg: #fff;
      --text: #1a1a1a;
      --text-secondary: #555;
      --text-muted: #888;
      --accent: #2563eb;
      --accent-hover: #1d4ed8;
      --border: #e8e8e8;
      --shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
      --shadow-hover: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
      --gradient: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
    }
    
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: var(--text);
      background: var(--bg);
      min-height: 100vh;
    }
    
    .container {
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 64px 24px;
    }
    
    /* Hero - 更现代的设计 */
    .hero {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 64px;
      padding: 48px 0;
    }
    
    .avatar-wrapper {
      position: relative;
      display: inline-block;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    
    .avatar-wrapper::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      inset: -4px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--gradient);
      z-index: -1;
      opacity: 0.8;
    }
    
    .avatar {
      width: 120px;
      height: 120px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      object-fit: cover;
      border: 4px solid var(--card-bg);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }
    
    .hero-name {
      font-size: 36px;
      font-weight: 800;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      background: var(--gradient);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      background-clip: text;
    }
    
    .hero-bio {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto 28px;
      font-size: 16px;
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      line-height: 1.8;
    }
    
    .hero-links {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 16px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    
    .hero-links a {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 10px 20px;
      background: var(--card-bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 24px;
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 14px;
      transition: all 0.2s;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }
    
    .hero-links a:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-hover);
      border-color: var(--accent);
      color: var(--accent);
    }
    
    .hero-links svg {
      width: 18px;
      height: 18px;
    }
    
    /* 区块通用样式 */
    .section {
      margin-bottom: 56px;
    }
    
    .section-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    
    .section-icon {
      width: 36px;
      height: 36px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      background: var(--gradient);
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-size: 18px;
    }
    
    .section-title {
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--text);
    }
    
    /* 个人项目 - 卡片式 */
    .project-list {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 20px;
    }
    
    .project-card {
      background: var(--card-bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 28px;
      transition: all 0.3s;
      cursor: pointer;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    
    .project-card::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 4px;
      height: 100%;
      background: var(--gradient);
      opacity: 0;
      transition: opacity 0.2s;
    }
    
    .project-card:hover {
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-hover);
      transform: translateY(-4px);
    }
    
    .project-card:hover::before {
      opacity: 1;
    }
    
    .project-header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-start;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    
    .project-name {
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--text);
    }
    
    .project-arrow {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 20px;
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }
    
    .project-card:hover .project-arrow {
      color: var(--accent);
      transform: translateX(4px);
    }
    
    .project-desc {
      font-size: 15px;
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      line-height: 1.7;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    
    .project-tags {
      display: flex;
      gap: 8px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    
    .tag {
      font-size: 12px;
      padding: 5px 12px;
      background: var(--bg);
      border-radius: 20px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    
    /* 底部 */
    .footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding-top: 48px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    
    /* 响应式 */
    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .container {
        padding: 32px 20px;
      }
      
      .hero {
        padding: 32px 0;
      }
      
      .hero-name {
        font-size: 28px;
      }
      
      .avatar {
        width: 100px;
        height: 100px;
      }
      
      .project-card {
        padding: 20px;
      }
      
      .project-header {
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 8px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <!-- Hero - 居中大头像设计 -->
    <div class="hero">
      <div class="avatar-wrapper">
        <img src="/avatar.png" alt="张国鑫" class="avatar">
      </div>
      <h1 class="hero-name">游戏开发工程师 · NLP算法工程师</h1>
      <p class="hero-bio">
        现游戏开发工程师，前百度知识图谱算法工程师。探索AI技术在游戏开发中的提效应用与机制设计，深耕系统架构与性能优化，并基于程序化生成与涌现式设计构建动态游戏世界。
      </p>
      <div class="hero-links">
        <a href="https://github.com/zgx197" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
